Vnum            11211
Name            虛腹井緣~
Description
井緣外圍著一圈向內坍陷的封魄柱臺，柱臺殘光在井腹邊緣慢慢滑落，像在標示最後一段仍屬於裂腹外層的界線。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       NORTH
ExitVnum        11210
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        11212
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         井緣~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         柱臺~
End

End
